        <labelSuffix> (Level 1)</labelSuffix>
        <experienceRequired>0</experienceRequired>
        <description>18 damage in a wide spinning arc. Brief evasion veil during the spin — dodge chance improved for a moment. The grace of the pivot is its own defense.</description>
